Name: gts (Google TypeScript Style)
Short Name: gts
URL: https://github.com/google/gts
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: HEAD
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/gts
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/gts

Description:
Google's TypeScript style guide, configuration, linter, and automatic code fixer.

Local Modifications:
- Refactored into 100% Native Upstream Bun v1.4.4+ in packages/gts-bun (@google-bun/gts-bun).
- Fused with Google Style Guides 2026 (TS, Shell, Go, Python, Rust, C++, Dart/Flutter, Angular/Wiz),
  Upstream Bun (bun fmt, bun lint --type-aware, bun check TS 7 tsgo), and Oxc (oxlint/oxfmt/tsgolint).
